      "arabic": "١١٠٤١- حبيبة بنت مسعود بن خالد «٣»\n، من بني عامر بن زريق. بايعت رسول اللَّه ﷺ، لا تعرف لها رواية، قاله ابن مندة أيضا عن محمد بن سعد.",
      "english": "11041—Habiba bint Mas'ud ibn Khalid [3]\nShe was of the Banu Amir ibn Zurayq. She pledged allegiance to the Messenger of Allah (may Allah bless him and grant him peace). No narration is known from her. Ibn Manda likewise stated this on the authority of Muhammad ibn Sa'd.",
